sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as Caller (engine, CLI)
    participant Parser as AcdcParser
    participant Resolver as IncludeResolver
    Caller->>Parser: parse(ParseInput)
    Parser->>Resolver: read(requested path)
    Resolver-->>Parser: file and text, or None
    Parser-->>Caller: Dom
    Note over Parser,Caller: Blocks carry SourceSpans<br/>that map through includes.<br/>A panic becomes an Unsupported block<br/>and a DomWarning.
